    "q-110161": {
      "dom_id": "step-q110161",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "For babysitting, Mia receives payment, in dollars, given by the expression $35h+15,$ where $h$ is the time, in hours, she spends babysitting. \n\nWhat does the coefficient of $h$ represent in this context?",
      "worked_solution": "The expression tells us that Mia is paid $$35$ for each hour, plus a 'base fee' of $$15.$\n\nThe coefficient of  $h$ is $35.$  This represents the fee Mia charges for each hour she spends babysitting.",
