      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Paul is buying a cell phone at an online store. The price of the cell phone is $P$ dollars, and Paul also has to pay $$15$ for the shipping and handling of the product.\n\nWhat expression represents the total cost, in dollars, of the cell phone?",
      "worked_solution": "The price of the cell phone is $P$ dollars.  \n\nThe amount for shipping and handling is $$15.$\n\n Hence, Paul's total bill for the cell phone will be $P+15$ dollars.",
